{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こちらは〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4日連続で\nはなまるうどん単番で入ってる中田のブログです(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レッスンに行くまでのどこの駅に\nはなまるうどんがあるか\n把握しています・ω・←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木どこのロケやってきたよん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/06/0624193/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さっきまでお願いランキング見てたよ(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Whiteberryさんの「夏祭り」\nストライク！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幼稚園のときだけど\n好きだったの覚えてるな〜(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は\n美術の宿題の絵を描いてたんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絵の具で描いてる最中に寝ちゃって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろんなとこに筆あたったようで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝見たら絵がぐちゃぐちゃしてた(;_;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかも筆についていた色は黒っぽい色"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あーあー\nやっちまったなー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と言う今も\nあと一歩で寝そうなところで書いてます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分がいま\n何を書いてるかもわなんない←盛った"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりあえず"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうすぐ寝ます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「「答えちゃうお( °_ゝ°)ノ」」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そじ坊では何頼んでた？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n普通のざるそばよく食べてた！\n他にも食べたことあるけど\nあとは思い出せない(´・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本わさび派？おろしわさび派？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n本わさび！\n余ったわさびはちゃんと持ち帰ります"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/06/0624193/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"麺類で一番好きなのは？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n最近は全部好きだから\n気分によるかも(*_*)\n今はうどん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"祭りはたこやき派？お好み焼き派？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\nたこやきはお祭りで食べたことないな〜\nお好み焼きは1回だけあるから\nお好み焼き派で！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スイカとメロンどっちが好き？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\nメロンかなー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"服欲しいな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"買いに行きたいな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"行こうかな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/06/0624193/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}